/// The six swords (v3 design §2.3), restored 2026-11-16 as **data
/// only**: the first system was deleted for its per-sword hero bakes
/// (a model swap rebuilt the hero and froze the game), its ground
/// re-drop loop and its unlabeled chip. The revival keeps the rows
/// and drops all three failure modes — a weapon here is a stage
/// table and a tempo, nothing in the world and nothing on a button;
/// it changes hands only through the mission reward cards. The kit
/// owns the table; `combat::Weapon` owns the tempo lookup.
